{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-task-worktree#card-zh","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-task-worktree","commit":"4d62a8a90090d43e94a21864762225b85351ab19","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-task-worktree 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 Git 任务 worktree 插件：它在仓库内为任务创建独立分支和 checkout，并用持久清单记录状态。可从模型工具或 /worktree 命令创建、列出和查看 worktree，也能把主工作区未提交改动带入；用户还可直接提交分支、合并改动回主工作区或清理 checkout。空白会话可选择 worktree 模式并设置分支名，设置页可指定新会话默认模式；会话栏显示分支标记。适合需要并行隔离 DSH 编码任务、保留会话间工作并由用户控制收尾的场景。需要 Git 2.31+ 与 Node 20+。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-61","lib/manager.js:234-271","src/client/index.ts:152-179"]}
{"unit_id":"Letter2025__dsh-task-worktree#card-en","repo":"Letter2025/dsh-task-worktree","commit":"4d62a8a90090d43e94a21864762225b85351ab19","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-task-worktree adds isolated Git worktrees to DSH. Each task gets a branch and checkout in a manifest. Tools and /worktree commands manage them; users can carry changes, commit, merge back, or remove a checkout. Blank sessions can start in worktree mode. Requires Git 2.31+ and Node 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:31-61","lib/manager.js:234-271","src/client/index.ts:152-179"]}
